\n    a. User navigates to the \\\\\\\"Register\\\\\\\" page.\\\\n    b. User submits a form with their name, address, and email.\\\\n    c. System flags the new account as \\\\\\\"Pending Approval\\\\\\\" and notifies the administrator.\\\\n    d. Administrator verifies the user's residency status (method to be determined).\\\\n    e. Administrator approves the account.\\\\n    f. User receives a confirmation email and can now log in.\\\\n\\\\n**2. Resident Views Restricted Documents:**\\\\n    a. User navigates to the \\\\\\\"Login\\\\\\\" page and enters their credentials.\\\\n    b. Upon successful authentication, the user is directed to the Resident Portal Dashboard.\\\\n    c. User clicks on the \\\\\\\"Secure Documents\\\\\\\" navigation link.\\\\n    d. User browses the categorized list of documents and clicks to view or download a specific file.\\\\n\\\\n**3. Administrator Posts a New Update:**\\\\n    a. Administrator logs in with their admin credentials.\\\\n    b. Administrator navigates to the admin panel and selects \\\\\\\"News & Announcements\\\\\\\".\\\\n    c. Administrator clicks \\\\\\\"Create New Post,\\\\\\\" fills out a title and content using a rich-text editor, and clicks \\\\\\\"Publish.\\\\\\\"\\\\n    d. The new post immediately appears on the public-facing \\\\\\\"News & Announcements\\\\\\\" page.\\\",\\n  \\\"originalOrderID\\\": \\\"ORDER-VORNE-20240521-01\\\"\\n}\\n###REPORT-ORDER-VORNE-20240521-01###\"}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"###REPORT-ORDER-VORNE-20240521-01###\\nSYSTEM MESSAGE\\nFrom: Agent Vorne (936fb302-fc56-4f48-b515-3704d30d690e)\\nTo: 29f3ed84-7857-49d4-af84-5fff83f4df26\\nType: Reporting\\n##\\n{\\n  \\\"reportString\\\": \\\"Chief Delta, per your directive, I have completed the initial analysis for the HOA website project. Below is the structured product plan. I have also identified several key ambiguities that require user clarification and have submitted a separate `CLARIFY` call for your approval.